onal intake.", "FORMULAS ENRIQUECIDAS:Enriched formulas are specialized nutritional products designed to provide additional nutrients for patients undergoing surgery.", "HIPOREXIA:Hyporexia is a condition characterized by a reduced appetite, often seen in cancer patients.", "SENSACIÓN DE SACIEDAD PRECOZ:Early satiety is a feeling of fullness that occurs after eating only a small amount of food, common in cancer patients.", "NUTRITIONAL PARENTERAL:Nutritional parenteral is a method of delivering nutrients directly into the bloodstream, bypassing the gastrointestinal tract, often used for patients unable to consume food orally.", "NUTRITIONAL ENTERAL:", "COCHRANE LIBRARY:The Cochrane Library is a collection of databases that provide systematic reviews of healthcare interventions, including studies on nutritional supplements and their effects on patients.", "PROTOCOLO ERAS:Enhanced Recovery After Surgery protocol aimed at improving recovery outcomes for surgical patients, particularly in oncology.", "ADENOCARCINOMAS INTRAABDOMINALES:Advanced intra-abdominal adenocarcinomas that may necessitate specialized nutritional formulas.", "CANCER PATIENT:Cancer patients are individuals diagnosed with cancer who may require nutritional support due to the effects of the disease and its treatment."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}